<task id="28ce6440-5463-11e2-a497-0016cbad0bd0" status="1" creationDateTime="2013-01-01 17:32:43.764578" modificationDateTime="2025-12-22 22:28:42.077279" subject="This task is dependent" expandedContexts="('prerequisiteviewerintaskeditor', 'taskviewer')" plannedstartdate="2013-01-01 17:32:00" priority="3" prerequisites="e9f1cf82-5462-11e2-b0b5-0016cbad0bd0">
<description>
It has "Welcome to Task Coach" as a prerequisite.
Even though this has a planned start time in the past,
it is inactive until the prerequisite is completed,
Then, it gets marked "late"
So, hiding inactive tasks will hide it until the prerequisite is done
</description>
</task>
